{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0058-s001", "text": "Det är lättare att sköta ärenden i Finland när personuppgifterna och familjeförhållandena har lagrats i befolkningsdatasystemet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T070915068145+0000-2/hb-c12-u0058-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.936598639455783, "peak": 0.262237548828125, "generation_seconds": 25.652169916778803, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0058-s002", "text": "Det är också viktigt att adressen och de övriga uppgifterna är uppdaterade i systemet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T070915068145+0000-2/hb-c12-u0058-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.31890869140625, "generation_seconds": 20.9990779759828, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0059-s001", "text": "MDB är närvarande vid många livshändelser i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T070915068145+0000-2/hb-c12-u0059-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.305633544921875, "generation_seconds": 15.879585165064782, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0059-s002", "text": "Myndigheten ansvarar för bland annat borgerliga vigslar, registrering av barns namn och namnändringar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T070915068145+0000-2/hb-c12-u0059-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.28753662109375, "generation_seconds": 24.90732309105806, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0059-s003", "text": "Dessutom främjar MDB digitaliseringen av samhället.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T070915068145+0000-2/hb-c12-u0059-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.2919921875, "generation_seconds": 14.387020786991343, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0060-s001", "text": "Skatteförvaltningen ansvarar för att samla in de flesta skatter i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T070915068145+0000-2/hb-c12-u0060-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.826666666666667, "peak": 0.39752197265625, "generation_seconds": 18.857118308078498, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0060-s002", "text": "Dessutom ansvarar Skatteförvaltningen för att skattepengarna förmedlas vidare till olika offentliga aktörer, vars verksamhet finansieras med skattemedel.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T070915068145+0000-2/hb-c12-u0060-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.096054421768708, "peak": 0.32611083984375, "generation_seconds": 45.64830982405692, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0060-s003", "text": "Skatteförvaltningen ger också råd i frågor som gäller betalning av skatter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T070915068145+0000-2/hb-c12-u0060-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.396148681640625, "generation_seconds": 24.99170644604601, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
